label = "Brush"
tooltip = "The most basic of brushes that can simply elevate or lower terrain.

[color=DIM_GRAY][i]The following can be used on all brush related tools...[/i][/color]

[b]Shortcuts[/b]:
[ul]Shift+LMB+Drag: Add cells to the current draw selection.[/ul]

[ul]Shift+MWU/MWD: Increase or decrease the brush size.[/ul]

[ul]Alt/RMB/Esc: Reset the current draw selection.[/ul]"
